      <h1 id="vcp-preparing-environment" class="group scroll-mt-20">Preparing the environment for virtualized control planes<a href="#vcp-preparing-environment" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>Prepare your hosting cluster environment before deploying a virtualized control plane cluster. This includes installing and configuring KubeVirt Redfish and creating the control plane VMs.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
